  <name>Draco Download Manager</name>
  <summary>Fast multi-connection downloads with browser integration</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.hafij-bge">
    <name>Md Hafijur Rahman</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Draco speeds up downloads by splitting files across up to 32 connections, resumes broken
      downloads exactly where they stopped, and captures downloads and videos from your browser.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Pause, resume and crash recovery</li>
      <li>Browser extension for Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi and Firefox</li>
      <li>Video downloads with quality choice and subtitles (YouTube and 1000+ sites via yt-dlp)</li>
      <li>Queues with a scheduler, site grabber, batch downloads and a speed limiter</li>
      <li>14 themes, including a classic Windows-style look</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.draco.DracoDM.desktop</launchable>
